WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.440
What?!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.270
You've lost track of our people
in the Guyana Highlands?!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.610
Yes.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.400
We cannot reach our troops...

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.860
...recovering the remains
of the Devil Gundam.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.990
What could have happened
in the Guyana Highlands?

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.140
Domon.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.650
There's something creepy
about that container.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.810
Yeah.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.500
I've got a bad feeling, too.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.700
It has finally arrived, Master East.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.570
Within this jack-in-the-box
is our dream.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:26.620
This evening...

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.870
...Neo Hong Kong was eclipsed
by the shadow...

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.460
...of a giant, mysterious container.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.590
What could be inside
this container?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.670
The key to that container
appears to be...

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.880
...Domon's next opponent.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.100
Neo Italy
Neros Gundam

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:45.850
That is, Michelo Chariot.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.310
Moreover...

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.930
...one of the mysterious
Gundams that attacked Domon...

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:53.270
...on his way to Neo Hong Kong's
Final Battlegrounds...

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.320
...is after him again.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:56.900
And now!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:01.530
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:07.790
Dangerous Trap!
Neros Gundam Strikes Back

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.220
<i>Though favored to win the title,</i>
<i>Neo Japan's God Gundam</i>...

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.890
...<i>is being pushed to the brink</i>
<i>by Neo Kenya's Gundam Zebra!</i>

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:29.680
What?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.070
Good thinking, to fight
with the sun to your back!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.200
But...!

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.200
Vulcan!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.500
Domon!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.210
Young one, say your prayers!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:02.220
You must be dreaming to
believe you can beat me!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.930
How dare you!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.810
Erupting...

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.440
...God Finger!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.440
Heat End!

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:33.450
Domon!

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.000
<i>He's powerful!</i>
<i>God Gundam is truly powerful!</i>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.840
<i>Will he sweep the tournament</i>
<i>as he declared?!</i>

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.840
You did it, Domon.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.640
No surprise, since you
did defeat me, after all.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.300
This is a joke!

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:53.140
Sweep the tournament, huh?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.850
He keeps on using
that dirty technique.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.270
If it weren't for that,
I certainly would've beaten him!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.610
The same goes for me!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:01.820
No.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.990
You're wrong to hold
a grudge against him.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.360
What did you say?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.800
Nothing about his fighting
could be deemed unfair.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.830
Can't you accept the fact that
you lost because he was better?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.000
Why, you!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.080
This is quite amusing.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.530
Gundam Fighters joining together
to grumble and complain?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.140
You're...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.380
Michelo Chariot, huh?

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:31.430
If you want to get back
at Domon Kasshu, follow me.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.190
Money's on the table.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.080
What're those Gundam Fighters
talking about?

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.330
Don't deceive me!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.630
I've got my pride
as a Gundam Fighter.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.170
I cannot agree with your plan.

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:06.800
I'm going.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:08.970
Oh, my.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.340
That is one stubborn man.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.120
So, can I assume that the
three of you...

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.810
...don't have any problem
with my plan?

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.570
It's certainly an intriguing idea.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.520
Give me some more details.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:33.320
Domon!

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.190
Let's play, Domon!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.120
Let's play!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.200
Ming. Hoy.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.210
Come on, it's your bedtime.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.250
Not now!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.090
We're going to play with Domon!

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:43.130
Hey!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.770
Domon!

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.340
There's a call for you!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.130
A call for me?

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.010
Domon Kasshu here.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.180
I'm Carlos of Neo Spain.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.180
The Fighter piloting
Matador Gundam.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:57.970
What?

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.310
I have something important
to talk about.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.600
Please come to my place at once.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.400
Hang on, Carlos!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.070
Hey!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.450
What does Neo Spain's
Fighter want?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.990
I've already fought him...

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.200
Hey! Hi, Domon!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.580
Allenby?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.980
Domon!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.540
Partying it up again?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.830
What's wrong with that?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.880
In any case, what business
do you have with Neo Spain?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.340
Actually, I'd like to know, too.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.130
How weird.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.680
Wh-what was that?

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.100
What's going on?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.270
This is...!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.820
Hey, Domon.
You owe me an explanation.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.620
I could've died there.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.620
Carlos!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.280
Talk to me, Carlos!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.250
You're our only Fighter!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.830
Come on, Carlos! Say something!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.710
So, that's Carlos.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.540
But...

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:14.090
What did he want to tell me?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.060
Michelo!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.430
Stop! Michelo!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.810
Wait! Domon!

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.020
Domon!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.370
Domon.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.700
What the hell's going on?!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.670
Hey, Domon Kasshu!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.750
You looking for someone?

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.130
It's that man.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.720
Michelo!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.300
I got a lot of things
I want to ask you!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.590
And I want answers!

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.600
And what if I refuse?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.810
Then I'll force it out of you!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.480
Take this!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.480
Silver Kick!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.440
Think you can still hurt me
with that kick?!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.190
To be honest, I didn't think so!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.490
But how about this?!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.780
Spectrum Beam Kick!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.450
What?!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.040
Domon!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.040
Awesome move.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:34.170
I look forward to
my Fight against you.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.430
That guy.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.180
When did he develop
that technique?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.390
Domon!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:44.890
Are you all right?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.770
Well, see for yourself.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:47.640
Hey!

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.900
That explosion earlier...

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.730
He might've been behind it.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.980
What's that?

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.110
What are you talking about?

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.820
Michelo and Carlos
were having an argument?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.820
Not just the two of them.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:03.330
There were a few other Fighters.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.370
They were discussing something.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.420
I have a question about
a customer who was here.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.040
Sorry, I can't help you.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:17.630
I'm not at liberty to discuss
our customers' private affairs.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.720
I don't want to cause you trouble.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.100
I only need a little information.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.600
I'm very sorry about this, sir.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.730
I'll leave right after I've
finished my business.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.980
We have a reputation for
high standards here, sir.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.610
This is no place for you!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.820
All right!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.980
I prefer not to stir up
any more trouble.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.040
What's that all about?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:02.140
Well, well. We have an unusual
guest who's come to visit today.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.390
Wong?!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:15.110
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.510
Wow!

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:22.490
It's beautiful!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.700
Yes, isn't it?

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.540
When I stand here...

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.580
...I can't help thinking that
Neo Hong Kong belongs to me.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.040
And you, too.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.040
What?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:34.790
Hey.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.670
You'd know if Michelo and his
guys come here, wouldn't you?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:43.260
I could easily find out if
I were to look into it.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.320
But now...

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:47.720
...I want to talk about Domon.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.850
About me?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.390
Domon Kasshu.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.850
From Neo Japan.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.600
Twenty years old.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:12:00.070
Trained under Master Asia from
the time you were a small boy.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.190
A year ago...

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.780
...you became a Gundam Fighter
upon returning home.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.820
How did you...?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.200
Your mother passed away.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.910
Your father, Dr. Kasshu, fell ill
and is in a hospital.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.830
And your brother Kyoji
has disappeared.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.540
Rumor has it that you met him
in the Guyana Highlands.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.340
How was your reunion with him?

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.430
None of your business.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.260
I want to ask you...

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.560
...why are Chapman and Michelo,
once defeated by me...

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.890
...taking part in this tournament?

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:35.270
As the top official of
the Gundam Fight...

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.110
...you should be able to
give me an explanation.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.610
I hate to tell you...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:42.990
...but I'm not in a position to give
any information on other nations.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:43.820
But...

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.700
...if you're adamant about this,
defeat Michelo...

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.990
...and ask him that question
yourself, face to face.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.000
However...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.210
...don't underestimate him, or
you might be in for a big surprise.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.250
Well...

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.010
...I certainly look forward
to seeing you...

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:05.580
...achieve that sweep that you
so boldly promised.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.390
Go!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.020
Go faster!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.400
You got it!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.020
Chibodee.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.460
You're going much too fast.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.950
Have a little faith
in my technique.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.460
What's this guy doing?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.000
Goddamn!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.900
That bastard.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.610
Was this an accident?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.570
Or perhaps...

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.240
What?!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.320
You guys were attacked, too?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.620
Yes.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.790
A steel frame suddenly
toppled over.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.750
Luckily...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.540
...I managed to escape unscathed.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:22.250
I almost got creamed by a bus.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.920
With us...

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.300
...there was a mysterious
explosion where we're staying.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.470
These can't be coincidences.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.930
This probably means somebody's
out to get all of us.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.480
That's right.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.150
It's Schwarz Bruder.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.570
But who could be coming after us?

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.440
Something lurking
behind the scenes...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.530
...is finally making its move.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.310
Lurking within these grounds?

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.440
They aren't called the Shuffle Alliance
for nothing.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:03.080
I thought it'd be an easy task
to get rid of them all at once.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:06.920
Well, now it's Michelo's turn
to take care of them.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.430
Just leave it to me.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:12.140
I've been waiting for this...

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.550
...for a long time.

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:25.690
Back then, I made
a promise to myself.

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:29.360
That I would take
my revenge against you.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.430
Even if it means selling
my soul to the devil!

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.870
Michelo Chariot!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.870
I didn't expect to fight
against you again.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.840
Domon...

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.210
...you beat him before...

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.330
...but be on your guard.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.550
Yeah.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.840
If I'm going to solve the mystery
of this tournament...

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.520
...I've got to defeat him!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.260
Well.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.260
You met Domon, did you?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.220
Your pupil impressed me.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.100
It attests to your greatness.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.390
He could be the ideal candidate
we've been looking for.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:07.520
But I'm going to test him
a little more seriously...

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.900
...starting with Michelo Chariot.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.740
Right.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.200
<i>Now!</i>

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.360
<i>God Gundam versus Neros Gundam!</i>

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.200
<i>The match is about to begin!</i>

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.740
Gundam Fight!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.370
Ready!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.830
Go!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.720
Not bad.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.010
Here I go!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.050
Spectrum Beam Kick!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.730
Get real!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.400
Domon!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.030
Allenby!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.410
Take this! And this!
And this!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:01.790
Domon!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.950
Allenby?

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:04.790
That's right! Listen carefully!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.080
Wait a minute!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.710
You can't give out orders.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.340
You're a Fighter from
another country!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.050
What is this?!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.610
Just keep your trap shut!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.800
Stay out of it, old timer!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.430
"Old timer"?

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.680
Listen carefully, Domon.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.970
There'll be a break in
your opponent's assault.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.850
Wait for that chance, then strike!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.520
For that chance...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.080
Looks like I win this time.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.110
Perish!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:31.980
My chance!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.570
What?

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.240
Michelo!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.330
Awesome!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.090
What the...?!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.590
What's that explosion?

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:00.760
Let's go and see!

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.930
Well, looks like
it's finally begun.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.890
Domon's true Fight.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.190
Did I get him?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:14.150
Or what?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.580
I-it's him...!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.620
What's happening in there?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:31.880
What's that?

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.840
What is that?

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.730
Where did he go?

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.340
I-I won't lose to...

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.600
...a scumbag like him!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.530
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.950
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.580
Erupting...

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:58.130
...God Finger!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.240
It seems the outcome's clear.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.030
Wh-what happened in there?

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.610
Where's God Gundam?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.740
Where's Domon?

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.910
Did I get him?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.920
H-hey, that's...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.130
Michelo! What's going on?!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.190
This whole thing is turning
into something strange.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.520
That's right.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.730
Something incredibly big is...

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.150
...looming over Neo Hong Kong.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.670
Be careful not to
let your guard down.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.370
Even the impressive Michelo
couldn't get the job done.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:18.050
Domon is a member of
the Shuffle Alliance.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:19.710
Don't underestimate him.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.520
The Shuffle Alliance
has stayed in the shadows...

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.220
...and kept order in this world.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.260
However...

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:29.300
...as long as I maintain power
over space itself...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.310
...they won't have
any reason to exist.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.770
Don't you agree with me?

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:42.610
And now it belongs to me.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.450
A massive power equal
to that of God.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.830
I plan to use this enormous
power to great effect...

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:03.630
...in order to maintain my position
as the supreme ruler of all space.

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:27.820
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.320
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.620
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:43.290
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:46.960
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:53.680
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.930 --> 00:23:01.230
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:35.850
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.810
There's been a murder!

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:41.600
A dark shadow pursues Maria
Louise, who witnessed the crime.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:44.360
George fights to protect her...

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:47.820
...but will he be able to
defeat John Bull Gundam?

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:51.150
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:54.700
Emissary of Darkness! Chapman rises again.

00:23:53.870 --> 00:24:00.470
Emissary of Darkness!
Chapman Rises Again

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.450
Ready! Go!
